        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Effective January 1, 2001, New Hires will be eligible to make contributions to the Investment Plan as of the first pay period of the month following or coincident with their third month anniversary, but will not be eligible for any Company match on their contributions to the Investment Plan until the first pay period of the month following or coincident with their three (3) year anniversary. Company matching contributions will then be made in accordance with the schedules contained in Article VIII (2) (b).",
